WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.569
♪ (AMBIENT MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:03.002 --> 00:00:04.537
ANNOUNCER (OVER MICROPHONE):
<i> I wanna thank everyone
 for joining us</i>

00:00:04.571 --> 00:00:07.407
<i>to celebrate the proudest moment
 in Easttown sports history.</i>

00:00:07.774 --> 00:00:10.209
And finally,
Miss Lady Hawk herself,

00:00:10.243 --> 00:00:12.578
Mare Sheehan!

00:00:12.612 --> 00:00:15.448
(CHEERING, WHOOPING)

00:00:17.884 --> 00:00:18.952
JAN KELLY:<i> See this yet?</i>

00:00:19.018 --> 00:00:20.219
Big write-up in the<i> Tribune.</i>

00:00:20.586 --> 00:00:22.588
I'm gonna frame it
and hang it up in your office.

00:00:22.622 --> 00:00:24.256
Yeah, please don't.

00:00:25.424 --> 00:00:27.427
MOTHER (OVER TV):
<i> My daughter's been missing
 for exactly one year,</i>

00:00:27.460 --> 00:00:29.195 line:0%
<i> and the police
 aren't doing anything.</i>

00:00:30.296 --> 00:00:31.731
FRANK SHEEHAN:
<i> How's your mother doing?</i>

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:33.933
-She's being a hero.
-(CHUCKLES) Yeah.

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:36.269
MARE SHEEHAN:<i> Of all the houses
 my ex-husband could move into,</i>

00:00:36.302 --> 00:00:38.071
he has to buy the one
right behind mine.

00:00:38.438 --> 00:00:39.973
Well, I heard he got
a really good deal on it.

00:00:40.440 --> 00:00:42.709
(BOTH LAUGH)

00:00:44.710 --> 00:00:45.945
(CELL PHONE VIBRATES)

00:00:47.980 --> 00:00:49.049
Hey.

00:00:53.953 --> 00:00:56.156
♪ (DRAMATIC MUSIC PLAYS) ♪

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.791
MARE:
The Easttown Police Department
received a call

00:00:58.824 --> 00:01:01.160
reporting a dead body
in Creedham Creek.

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:02.929
We've decided to bring in
a county detective

00:01:02.962 --> 00:01:04.264
-to assist with the case.
-(PEOPLE EXCLAIMING)

00:01:04.998 --> 00:01:07.266
How do you like
working with my mom so far?

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.801
We're just getting started out.

00:01:08.968 --> 00:01:10.102
Any tips?

00:01:10.836 --> 00:01:12.338
SIOBHAN SHEEHAN:
<i> Lower your expectations.</i>

00:01:12.605 --> 00:01:14.974
-Should we do this outside?
-No.

00:01:15.007 --> 00:01:16.508
-All right, let's go, Br--
-Hey, hey, woah.

00:01:16.575 --> 00:01:18.077
-Woah, what's happening?
-Mare, what did she do?

00:01:18.110 --> 00:01:20.479
She knows what's happening,
Tony, she knows.

00:01:20.513 --> 00:01:21.514
All right, let's go.

00:01:22.082 --> 00:01:23.582
Are you friends
with these people?

00:01:23.616 --> 00:01:24.584
Yeah.

00:01:25.084 --> 00:01:26.085
♪ (MUSIC BUILDS) ♪

00:01:26.119 --> 00:01:27.586
Why do they call you Lady Hawk?

00:01:27.620 --> 00:01:29.856
I made a shot
in a basketball game.

00:01:30.289 --> 00:01:31.490
RICHARD RYAN:
<i> Must have been some shot.</i>

00:01:31.523 --> 00:01:33.025
Around here, yeah.

00:01:33.626 --> 00:01:35.795
PRIEST: The terrible events
of this past year

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:37.663
have ravaged this community.

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:39.866
Hey, Mare. Who did this?

00:01:42.035 --> 00:01:43.503
BILLY ROSS:
<i> You get the son of a bitch.</i>

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.874
'Cause if you don't,
I'll kill him myself.

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:50.977
MARE:<i> I can feel it...</i>

00:01:51.344 --> 00:01:52.878
<i>this expectation from people...</i>

00:01:53.646 --> 00:01:56.716
<i> to be something I don't think
 I'm good enough to be.</i>

00:01:57.550 --> 00:01:58.718
Hey!

00:01:58.784 --> 00:02:00.719
I think you're a hero.

00:02:00.786 --> 00:02:01.820
You feel I'm a fool.

00:02:01.854 --> 00:02:03.556
You're a lot of things
I don't like,

00:02:03.623 --> 00:02:04.691
<i> but you're not a fool.</i>

00:02:07.527 --> 00:02:09.194
It might be a good thing
to step away.

00:02:09.895 --> 00:02:11.297
CHIEF CARTER:
<i>I know what you've been through</i>

00:02:11.331 --> 00:02:13.233
<i>and I know you're worth saving.</i>

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:15.735
Recommit yourself.

00:02:17.803 --> 00:02:19.205
I'm gonna find out everything.

00:02:19.238 --> 00:02:20.373
(TIRES SCREECHING)

00:02:21.474 --> 00:02:23.142
<i> Every thing.</i>

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:29.082 line:0%
♪ (MUSIC CONTINUES,
CONCLUDES) ♪

